---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="页面未找到 - 好机场" description="你访问的页面不存在，请返回好机场首页或机场指南文章库。">
  <main class="site-container grid min-h-[65vh] place-items-center py-16">
    <section class="surface w-full max-w-3xl p-8 text-center sm:p-14">
      <span class="text-sm font-black tracking-[.18em] text-brand-600">404 NOT FOUND</span>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-black text-ink-950 sm:text-5xl">页面不存在</h1>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-xl text-base leading-8 text-slate-600">当前链接可能已经调整，或者输入的地址有误。你可以返回首页查看机场推荐，也可以进入机场指南文章库继续阅读。</p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
        <a class="rounded-full bg-brand-500 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-black text-white" href="/">返回首页</a>
        <a class="rounded-full border border-brand-200 bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-black text-brand-600" href="/blog/">机场指南</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
